nto the theatre must fit on your lap or completely under your seat without 
 
blocking any aisles. Avoid bringing packages\, luggage\, and backpacks. Som
 
e items must be checked. (3) The show's dialogue is in English\, while the 
 
songs are performed in the original Spanish from the beloved album. But Bue
 
na Vista Social Club is truly a show for everyone. The songs enrich the sto
 
ry\, infusing it with an authentic Havana heartbeat. You won't lose the plo
 
t if you don't understand the lyrics - what matters most is how the music m
 
akes you feel. (4) This production uses theatrical haze and smoke. (5) Tick
 
ets are on a delayed delivery. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com
 
/buena-vista-social-club-new-york-new-york-10-30-2026/event/Z1r9uZruZqGZ1Av
 
