g games! Every time a buzz word is spoken\, the narrator dings a bell & eve
 
ryone drinks-actors & audience alike! Spend your 31st in Halloween Town\; c
 
ome in costume for the Intermission Costume Contest & enjoy themed drinks a
 
mong fellow movie fans! *To ensure everyone has a safe experience\, please 
 
take a moment to review our restricted items beforehand. While we love your
 
