ted weekends of the year! Join us on Saturday\, October 31st --- Halloween 
 
Night --- for ALEGRIA HALLOWEEN\, followed by VIVA Afterhours on Sunday mor
 
ning\, November 1st. Two back-to-back events\, four incredible DJs and 16 h
 
ours of nonstop music celebrating Halloween in New York City. For more than
 
 two decades\, ALEGRIA HALLOWEEN has become a NYC tradition\, known for its
 
 incredible costumes\, spectacular production and a packed dance floor that
 
